# Riddles in the Dark: the opponent sees what is in the face-up pile and only how many cards the face-down one holds (CR 700.3). Bot1 looks at Lightning Bolt, Island,
# Counterspell and Plains and makes the Bolt and the Island the face-down pile. This time Bot2 takes the face-down pile for Bot1: the Bolt and the Island go to
# Bot1's hand (never revealed to Bot2) and the face-up Counterspell and Plains to its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Riddles in the Dark
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Counterspell
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Riddles in the Dark.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot2.Modes(Face-down pile)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Riddles in the Dark; Plains; Counterspell
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Revealed = (absent)
